[[File:Vagrant Encampment.png|thumb|300px]]
The '''Vagrant Encampment''' is a small camp just south of the [[Greymane Wall]] in [[Gilneas]]. It was established by the refugees that camped in the shadow of the [[Greymane Wall]] in [[Silverpine Forest]], who came to Gilneas seeking safe haven only to find that it was just as bad as Silverpine.<ref>[[Camp Leader Gethenor#Quotes]]</ref>

