==As a quest objective==
* {{questlong|Alliance|32|Defying Orders}}

==Contains==
{{Book|content=
[[Edward Paddley|Paddley]], our operations in [[Westfall]] are reaching their peak. The golem production is steady and virtually flawless. [[Jared Voss|Voss]]' experiments with our secret biological component are fruitful as well. Despite this, it is in our best interest to make haste - [[Mathias Shaw|Shaw]] and [[SI:7|his lackeys]] are on the move and I cannot have them interfere with our cause.
----
While a few of our men are scouring the abandoned farms of [[Duskwood]], I need you and your subordinates to plunder the filthy nobles of [[Northwind]]. Make this a hasty operation, Paddley. The fat and indolent wretches don't deserve anything, so gut them if need be. Leave no witnesses. I expect steady reports, our contractors from the [[Venture Co.]] are neither patient nor cheap.
}}

